{"id":"vod_md_5344","vodId":"5344","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"弦音 -风舞高中弓道部-第二季","name_cn":"弦音 -风舞高中弓道部-第二季","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230923-1/51713aa7a78b37d65311bbf7e183fa95.jpg"},"summary":"不断寻找“自己”的弓之道他们的故事就在其上展开越是念想，内心就越是憎恶越是追求，色彩就越是暗淡为了保持“自己”，一边挣扎一边前进在注视喜欢之物的时光中，一边怀疑一边坚信向前迈步吧这条路就通向不知何时的“自己”弓道中的“胜”与“负”如何定义？“中靶”与“脱靶”又有何区别？有一群弓箭手，试图回答这些无法以数量衡量的问题。风舞高中弓道部的鸣宫凑在县大赛中夺冠，日复一日地将热情倾注于弓道。与此同时，曾经籍籍无名的辻峰高中弓道部打入地区大赛。面带不可一世的笑容，挡在凑等人面前的，是握有辻峰弓道部实权的二阶堂永亮。他们的思绪化为箭矢，飞射而出。他们的弓道相互碰撞之时，将诞生尚无人知晓的答案。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画,运动"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-23 07:37:20","episodeCount":13,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/wInvjdyh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/KNPMhQCb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/c80YPwt4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/IjB3YuTs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/AtTwWg3X/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/CpXnslcn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/uM9nwJqX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/9omcK4qM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/OCR6GQPc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/DlUDHxBy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/yuLh0MpA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/UKu79JcS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/Nx84THxi/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:56.725Z"}